{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415768","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415768","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041576801:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576802:1":{"text":"여기에도 짜증 나는 짐승이 있군.","source_cn":"这里也有讨人厌的野兽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x783C105CD4B5998E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576803:1":{"text":"여기서 뭘 하고 있는 거지?","source_cn":"你在这里做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA016050EA81BFEFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576804:1":{"text":"쥐... 잡고 있어.","source_cn":"我……抓老鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67ADA1201EC31FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576805:1":{"text":"쥐?","source_cn":"老鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC111569DF608193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576806:1":{"text":"쥐... 해로워. 주군께서... 쥐를 잡으라고 했어.","source_cn":"老鼠……有害。主君交待我……抓老鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D1BBBD5F59C9BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576807:1":{"text":"흠... 틀린 말은 아니군. 네 주군은 누구지?","source_cn":"你的主君倒没说错。你的主君是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE07FCC0291534C37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576808:1":{"text":"주군께서... 신분, 밝히지 말라고 하셨어.","source_cn":"主君交待我……不透露，身份。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAEA52E55D1708EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576809:1":{"text":"쥐를 잡으면 네 주군은 어떻게 하지? 상을 주나?","source_cn":"抓到老鼠后，你的主君会怎么做？奖励你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC510346B10B06AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576810:1":{"text":"가끔은... 하지만 가끔은 아니야.","source_cn":"有时……奖励，有时……不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x211E54AD1FF16780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576811:1":{"text":"그럼 왜 사냥감을 몰래 독차지하지 않는 거지? 상을 받지 못하면 배를 곯게 될 텐데?","source_cn":"那为什么不把猎物私吞呢？没有得到奖励，你会饿肚子吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF3CFBF8F6CF0234","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576812:1":{"text":"몰래 독차지?","source_cn":"私吞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BA948DA8C113C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576813:1":{"text":"네가 잡은 쥐를 그냥 네가 먹어 버리는 거지.","source_cn":"就是把抓到的老鼠，自己吃掉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE746F4BE6D67BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576814:1":{"text":"...맛없어.","source_cn":"……不好吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5691B8B0ED1874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576815:1":{"text":"그리고... 주군... 배신하면... 안 돼.","source_cn":"而且……不能……背叛……主君。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FFBE6994C40659E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576816:1":{"text":"하, 날개 달린 짐승들은 그 어리석은 충성심까지 똑같군.","source_cn":"呵，你们这些长着翅膀的野兽，连这股愚忠的架势都一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3968CC9B5B8F9F80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"오리안","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:翼":{"text":"윙","source":"翼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}